    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b93795cd465acfca",
      "translationZh": "我们感谢 Raushan Turganbay、Arthur Zucker 和 Pablo Montalvo Leroux 为将该模型贡献到 transformers 所作的努力。",
